---
// Newsletter component - reusable across pages
---

<section class="newsletter" data-reveal>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="newsletter-inner">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon">mail</span>
      <h2>Únete a nuestra comunidad</h2>
      <p>Suscríbete para recibir acceso anticipado a nuevas colecciones, tips de maquillaje y ofertas exclusivas.</p>
      <form class="newsletter-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault()">
        <input type="email" placeholder="Tu correo electrónico" required aria-label="Correo electrónico" />
        <button type="submit">Suscribirse</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .newsletter {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    background: var(--cream);
  }
  .newsletter-inner {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .newsletter .icon {
    font-size: 48px;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .newsletter h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .newsletter p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .newsletter-form {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .newsletter-form input {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    background: var(--surface);
    transition: border-color var(--anim-hover-fast);
  }
  .newsletter-form input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .newsletter-form button {
    padding: 0.875rem 2rem;
    background: var(--matte-black);
    color: var(--surface);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background var(--anim-hover-fast);
  }
  .newsletter-form button:hover {
    background: var(--accent-deep);
  }
</style>
